      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Parksley%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s streets honor early settlers: Elizabeth, Stauntan, and Chadbourne are named after a pioneering woman.",
